kind: llman.sdd.delta
ops[5]{op,req_id,title,statement,from,to,name}:
  add_requirement,tui1,"inline-render","The TUI MUST render inline using ratatui Viewport::Inline with Terminal::insert_before to commit finalized lines to the terminal scrollback; the TUI MUST NOT enter the alternate screen (no ?1049h). Evidence: ratatui 0.30.2 insert_before is a stable public API (ratatui-core-0.1.2/src/terminal/inline.rs:109); pi renders inline with no alt-screen (grep of packages/tui/src finds ?1049h only in external-editor cleanup); codex is inline too.",null,null,null
  add_requirement,tui2,"in-process-driver","The TUI MUST drive the agent via app::core::driver::InProcessDriver (the same Driver path as print mode); the TUI MUST NOT default to a RemoteDriver or an auto-spawned daemon. Evidence: codex AppServerTarget::Embedded is the TUI default (codex-rs/tui/src/lib.rs:814-830); pi InteractiveMode holds AgentSessionRuntime directly (coding-agent/src/modes/interactive/interactive-mode.ts:265,391).",null,null,null
  add_requirement,tui3,"three-surfaces-coexist","The rpc (stdio JSONL), server (REST+WS), and tui (inline) application surfaces MUST coexist; none MAY be removed in the name of unification. Evidence: codex keeps in-process TUI + app-server stdio (powers VSCode ext) + app-server-daemon (unix socket); pi keeps in-process TUI + --mode rpc + orchestrator serve; neither project dropped any transport.",null,null,null
  add_requirement,tui4,"reuse-contract","The TUI MUST import only crate::agent (mod-level), crate::app::core (Driver/composition), crate::protocol, and crate::domain; it MUST NOT import crate::agent::session, crate::agent::runtime, or crate::infra. Slash command semantics MUST reuse protocol::Command variants rather than inventing a parallel command vocabulary.",null,null,null
  add_requirement,tui5,"no-skeleton-spray","Every file created under src/app/tui/ MUST be driven by a real entry point (tui::run) within its own change; the TUI MUST NOT use #[allow(dead_code)] to land undriven skeleton code. Undriven skeleton is the documented root cause of the prior two failed TUI attempts.",null,null,null
op_scenarios[7]{req_id,id,given,when,then}:
  tui1,inline-viewport,"the TUI source is inspected","Viewport::Inline is used and insert_before commits finalized lines","no EnterAlternateScreen/?1049h is emitted and history remains in the terminal scrollback"
  tui1,scrollback-copy,"a conversation turn finishes in the TUI","the user scrolls up in the terminal","prior turns are visible in the native scrollback and selectable with the terminal native selection"
  tui2,inprocess-default,"xylitol is launched with no prompt and stdin is a TTY","the TUI starts","the agent is driven via InProcessDriver not RemoteDriver"
  tui3,rpc-retained,"the rpc surface is inspected after the TUI lands","--rpc dispatch and src/app/rpc.rs are checked","rpc mode is still present and functional"
  tui3,server-retained,"the server surface is inspected after the TUI lands","xylitol server run and src/app/server are checked","the server is still present and functional"
  tui4,no-infra-import,"the TUI source is inspected","imports under src/app/tui are checked","none import crate::agent::session crate::agent::runtime or crate::infra and slash commands map to protocol::Command"
  tui5,driven-on-land,"a file is added under src/app/tui","it is checked at change completion","it is reachable from tui::run and has no #[allow(dead_code)]"
